%% aoneahsan-cccs-copywriting — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Writing prose a human will read]) --> kind{What kind?}
    kind -->|docs / commit / UI / report| clarity
    kind -->|store listing / marketing / changelog| clarity

    clarity[Apply the clarity rules:<br/>omit needless words · active voice ·<br/>positive form · concrete language ·<br/>emphatic word last · one topic/paragraph]
    clarity --> honest{Any claim about<br/>what it does / privacy / a number?}
    honest -->|yes| verify[Honest framing: state what it does NOT do;<br/>privacy claim matches reality;<br/>cite a real source or cut the number]
    honest -->|no| store
    verify --> store

    store{Store-facing copy?}
    store -->|no| ship([Ship the prose])
    store -->|yes| brief[Short + factual: title/short/full within limits;<br/>depth belongs in the app/website, not the listing]
    brief --> banned{Contains a banned word?<br/>best/#1/top/free/AI-if-rule-based/<br/>user counts/testimonials/emojis-in-title}
    banned -->|yes| rewrite[Rewrite factual — cross-check policy JSONs]
    rewrite --> banned
    banned -->|no| ship

    banned -.consult if present.-> reg[(../policy/play-console + chrome-web-store rejection JSONs<br/>../rules/publishing-compliance.md)]

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class kind,honest,store,banned gate
    class trigger,ship terminal
